{"3695650":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Saint Slayer: Spear of Sacrilege","steam_appid":3695650,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4588660],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1698. A mysterious figure named Father Pacer has shattered the peace negotiated after the War of the Grand Alliance, obsessively and violently stealing Catholic relics throughout the Holy Roman Empire. Can the ex-soldier-turned-farmer Rudiger protect his people from a power-mad priest and his horde of monsters and minions? Can he become Saint Slayer?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3695650\/extras\/048ade03b53c50adaa05da663cfab2ae.poster.avif?t=1776692437\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3695650\/extras\/048ade03b53c50adaa05da663cfab2ae.webm?t=1776692437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3695650\/extras\/048ade03b53c50adaa05da663cfab2ae.mp4?t=1776692437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robust, 21-stage single player campaign... <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...that can be played entirely in two-player co-op! <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning, gory, and atmospheric NES-era pixel art <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer 8-bit chiptune soundtrack <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven intense boss fights <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and befriend animal familiars <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable upgrades and bonuses galore <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choice: Help or